{"id":"45e1649786ce1775","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-relative-complement.md","title":"Relative Complement","display":"df-relative-complement — Relative Complement","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-relative-complement","aliases":["93-df-relative-complement"],"display":"df-relative-complement — Relative Complement","depends_on":["[[93-df-heyting]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-relative-complement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-relative-complement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relative-complement — Relative Complement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"edc4ffdba40ef7c6\" href=\"?note=edc4ffdba40ef7c6\" title=\"93-df-heyting\">93-df-heyting</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf H)\\)</span> (Heyting algebra, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"edc4ffdba40ef7c6\" href=\"?note=edc4ffdba40ef7c6\" title=\"93-df-heyting\">93-df-heyting</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c,d\\in|\\mathbf H|\">\\(a,b,c,d\\in|\\mathbf H|\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelPComp}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelPComp}_{93}\\)</span> (relative-pseudocomplement predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}complement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelPComp}_{93}(c;a,b,\\mathbf H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf H)\\land a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf H|\\\\\n&amp;\\land a\\wedge^{\\mathbf H}c\\leq_{\\mathbf H^-}b\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall d\\in|\\mathbf H|\\;\\bigl(\na\\wedge^{\\mathbf H}d\\leq_{\\mathbf H^-}b\n\\to d\\leq_{\\mathbf H^-}c\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}complement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelPComp}_{93}(c;a,b,\\mathbf H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf H)\\land a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf H|\\\\\n&amp;\\land a\\wedge^{\\mathbf H}c\\leq_{\\mathbf H^-}b\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall d\\in|\\mathbf H|\\;\\bigl(\na\\wedge^{\\mathbf H}d\\leq_{\\mathbf H^-}b\n\\to d\\leq_{\\mathbf H^-}c\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}complement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf H)\\land a,b\\in|\\mathbf H|\n\\to\\forall c\\in|\\mathbf H|\\;\\bigl(\nc=a\\to^{\\mathbf H}b\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RelPComp}_{93}(c;a,b,\\mathbf H)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}complement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf H)\\land a,b\\in|\\mathbf H|\n\\to\\forall c\\in|\\mathbf H|\\;\\bigl(\nc=a\\to^{\\mathbf H}b\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RelPComp}_{93}(c;a,b,\\mathbf H)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Parentheses make equality with the implication value distinct from an object-language implication. The defining greatest-element condition does not assume completeness of the lattice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-heyting","status":"resolved","id":"edc4ffdba40ef7c6","ancho